# Only VITE_* variables are readable from the browser bundle — never put
# secrets or credentials here (see CLAUDE.md: "Nada de secretos en el front").

# Base URL for the API. In dev, Vite proxies /api to the API server (see vite.config.ts),
# so this can stay empty/relative. Set it explicitly (e.g. https://api.example.com/api/v1)
# for other environments. Optional — falls back to "/api/v1" if unset.
VITE_API_URL=/api/v1
